# A warp-specialized CTA of 8 warps in the annotated PTX: the blocks of
# one role run on warps 0-3, those of the other on warps 4-7, every lane;
# a block under `%ctaid.x < 64` runs so in 64 of the 128 CTAs. A block
# under a loop whose trips are not known runs an unknown number of
# times, the innermost such loop named; on that loop's header, `exec ?`.
# An `ldmatrix` address behind an xor of the thread index is unknown.
# A block under a branch the same for the whole CTA or warp runs when its
# comparison holds, with the branch's polarity: block 11 past
# `setp.lt.s32 %p63, %r1884, 1; @%p63 bra $L__BB0_56` when `%r1884 ≥ 1`,
# block 16 when `%r1883 ≤ %r100`, its loop's iteration as `iv`; the
# worker's blocks on a byte each warp loads from shared memory alike.
RUN: %ptxroof analyze --annotate --ncu %fixtures/gluon/attn_fwd_ws_kernel.sm_89.ncu.json %fixtures/gluon/attn_fwd_ws_kernel.sm_89.ptx | FileCheck "%s"
CHECK: {{^}}	setp.eq.b32 	%p58, %r1753, 0; // [<block 1>] warp 0-3 × lane * | exec 16,384/launch{{$}}
CHECK: {{^}}$L__tmp7: // warp 0-3 × lane * | CTAs %ctaid.x < 64 (64/128) | exec <= 16,384/launch{{$}}
CHECK: {{^}}	or.b32 	%r100, %r1880, 63; // [<block 11>] warp 0-3 × lane * | runs when uniform(%r1884@$L__BB0_39) ≥ 1 (branch at line 660, same for the whole CTA) | exec ? (trips of $L__BB0_39){{$}}
CHECK: {{^}}$L__BB0_43:{{ +}}// %.lr.ph601 // loop: trips ? (uniform(%r1884@$L__BB0_43) is defined in an enclosing loop: depends on %r1884, carried around an enclosing loop) | warp 0-3 × lane * | exec ?{{$}}
CHECK: {{^}}	shl.b32 	%r1228, %r101, 15; // [<block 16>] warp 0-3 × lane * | runs when 64·iv[$L__BB0_43] ≤ 128·⌊uniform(%r1880@$L__BB0_39)/128⌋ + 63 (branch at line 822, same for the whole CTA) | exec ? (trips of $L__BB0_43){{$}}
CHECK: {{^}}	ldmatrix.sync.aligned.m8n8.x4.shared.b16 {%r1040, %r1041, %r1064, %r1065}, [%r1230]; // shared load addr ? (depends on special register %tid.x, behind `xor.b32`){{$}}
CHECK: {{^}}	add.s32 	%r1234, %r61, %r1883; // [<block 17>] warp 0-3 × lane * | runs when 64·iv[$L__BB0_43] > 128·⌊uniform(%r1880@$L__BB0_39)/128⌋ - 63 (branch at line 1219, same for the whole CTA) | exec ? (trips of $L__BB0_43){{$}}
CHECK: {{^}}$L__BB0_2:{{ +}}// %.preheader568 // loop: trips ? (loop has multiple latches) | warp 4-7 × lane * | exec ?{{$}}
CHECK: {{^}}	setp.eq.b16 	%p3, %rs5, 1; // [<block 37>] warp 4-7 × lane * | runs when uniform(%rs5@2617) ≠ 0 (branch at line 2619, same for the whole warp) | exec ? (trips of $L__BB0_2){{$}}
CHECK: {{^}}$L__BB0_5:{{ +}}//   in Loop: Header=BB0_2 Depth=1 // warp 4-7 × lane * | runs when uniform(%rs5@2617) = 0 (branch at line 2619, same for the whole warp) | exec ? (trips of $L__BB0_2){{$}}
